SECTION I // NATURE OF THIS REPOSITORY
---------------------------------------

This repository contains public-facing materials for Nerviatas, including
but not limited to:

- Organization-wide GitHub configuration
- Issue and pull request templates
- Continuous integration / workflow definitions
- Documentation and branding assets
- Other meta-level resources for Nerviatas projects

This repository is public for transparency and integration with GitHub
workflows. It is **not** an open-source codebase and does **not** grant
general reuse rights over its contents.


